# Only web sources and the Cargo workspace needed to resolve the wallet build.
# In particular, never send a local ledger, plots, keys or .env files to Docker.
**
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!crates/**
!vendor/
!vendor/vnx-rust/
!vendor/vnx-rust/**
!apps/
!apps/wallet/
!apps/wallet/**
!apps/explorer/
!apps/explorer/**
!deploy/
!deploy/apps/
!deploy/apps/**
**/.git
**/target
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/artifacts
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.wasm-test
**/__pycache__
**/src-tauri
**/src-tauri/**
**/.env
**/.env.*
apps/wallet/src/backend/web/pkg
crates/*/tests
crates/*/benches
# The web build typechecks the shared desktop payload regression test too.
!apps/wallet/src-tauri/
!apps/wallet/src-tauri/tests/
!apps/wallet/src-tauri/tests/payloads.json
